DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T113000
SUMMARY:Hills! Nothing Better than a Hill Workout
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMEETUP POINT: 300 kingston Rd
 \, Pickering\n\nThis is a quick [..2.5..hour](http://..2.5..hour/) hike up
  and down focusing on building cardio and calf muscles.\nSame place every 
 Saturday and same hills where we increase the number of repetitions each w
 eek.\nThis is your time to bring it on!\nJust for fun you could bring a lo
 aded backpack!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/315297878/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260617T134550Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260617T134550Z
